{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena","name_zh":"花灵与灵光","name_en":"Pari and Khvarena","aliases":["花灵与灵光","Pari and Khvarena"],"category":"species","scope":"regional","regions":["Sumeru"],"summary":"灵光是为抵御灾厄而创造、能够净化深渊能量与污秽的神性力量，也可指其分化后的实体。西摩格将自身灵光与甘露结合并分化出灵光百种，其中具有智性的个体成为花灵。花灵栖居须弥苍漠囿土的甘露花海，长期承担守护、净化与抵御灾厄的职责。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_01","text":"灵光由 Nabu Malikata 创造，目的在于对抗预见中的灾厄；因其神性，灵光能够净化深渊能量及 Fandom 所称的“Forbidden Knowledge”。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"自远古创造后持续有效","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_02","text":"据传，Nabu Malikata 在第一次 Sabzeruz Festival 期间将灵光赠予 Greater Lord Rukkhadevata，希望借此减轻未来灾难。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"远古，灾厄以前","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_03","text":"“灵光”一词既可指最初的实体及其力量，也可指该实体分化后形成的单个或多个可数实体。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_04","text":"Greater Lord Rukkhadevata 曾将灵光塑造成神鸟西摩格。五百年前的灾厄中，西摩格进入甘露池并分解自身，形成无数灵光实体；其中具有智性的灵光成为花灵。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"五百年前的灾厄时期","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_05","text":"花灵是具有鸟类与花朵特征、源自西摩格的种族，主要居住在须弥苍漠囿土的甘露花海。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"灾厄后至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_06","text":"花灵是灵光诸形态中唯一具有智性的形态。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"花灵形成后至今","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_07","text":"花灵群体认为每名花灵都有命定的责任，且应独自承担并为其使命而活；这是花灵内部流传的使命观。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"长期","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_04"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_08","text":"花灵信奉前代水神厄歌莉娅，并认为其在五百年前的灾厄中遭污秽侵染，其意识留存在 Harvisptokhm。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"灾厄后至今","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_09","text":"关于花灵生命终点及受污个体的归宿，来源存在冲突：英文 Fandom 称花灵通常会化为净光翎并被送回甘露池，而遭深渊污秽侵染、被甘露花海拒绝的花灵会化为灵谷木；BWiki 则称无法回归甘露的受污花灵之力量会化为净光翎，需要他人将其带回甘露池。","status":"disputed","temporal_scope":"花灵生命终期","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_10","text":"五百年前，花灵曾与坎瑞亚战士、戴面具的剑士、东方来的独臂贤者及后来成为矫论团先祖的学者共同对抗深渊魔物。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"五百年前的灾厄时期","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_11","text":"近期共有五份灵光绝唱被收集。取得双角花冠并获承认为勇者的花灵能够触碰、聚集并引导这些灵光之力；灵光绝唱可用于离渡之仪、维持封印和净化受污区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"近期异象处理期间","visibility":"restricted_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02","local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01","local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02"]},{"fact_id":"sumeru_pari_khvarena_fact_12","text":"那先朱那称灵光绝唱是散落大地的“灵光百种”中最强大的实体；该强度排序在直接游戏文本中属于其个人陈述。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"近期异象处理期间","visibility":"secret_or_exceptional","source_ids":["local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"远古至灾厄以前","order_hint":1,"events":["Nabu Malikata 创造灵光以应对未来灾厄，并据传将其赠予 Greater Lord Rukkhadevata。","Greater Lord Rukkhadevata 将灵光塑成神鸟西摩格，使其承担守护生死边界的职责。"],"current_status":"灵光被赋予抵御未来灾厄的目的，并一度以西摩格的形态存在。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01"]},{"period":"五百年前的灾厄时期","order_hint":2,"events":["西摩格为拯救甘露池免受深渊污秽侵染而进入池中、分解自身，形成无数灵光实体；其中有智者成为花灵。","花灵与坎瑞亚战士、戴面具的剑士、独臂贤者及须弥学者并肩抵御深渊魔物。"],"current_status":"花灵由此成为灵光的有智形态，并继续在甘露花海及其周边承担抵御污秽的职责。","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02"]},{"period":"灾厄后至近期异象以前","order_hint":3,"events":["灵光绝唱被分散并隐藏于各地；其中一份由祖尔宛保留以备未来之需。","祖尔宛曾以灵光绝唱封闭甘露花海及相关遗迹，防止深渊魔物侵入。"],"current_status":"五份灵光绝唱在近期事件前保持分散或封存状态。","source_ids":["fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02"]},{"period":"近期异象处理期间","order_hint":4,"events":["斯露莎取得双角花冠后收集了五份灵光绝唱。","灵光绝唱被用于开启通路、净化荼泥黑渊及进入 Harvisptokhm；随后斯露莎完成仪式，污秽被驱散。","天上异象消失，Harvisptokhm 从树桩重新生长为巨树。"],"current_status":"近期污秽已被清除，天上异象已经消失；斯露莎并未因仪式而消亡，花灵仍居于甘露花海。","source_ids":["fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02","local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01","local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"普通居民可能只知道须弥北部沙漠存在禁区和异常天象。花灵的起源、灵光的具体性质、灵光绝唱的位置与相关仪式主要由花灵、矫论团传统保存者及少数直接调查者掌握。","likely_known_by":["花灵及其元老","矫论团中掌握传统与仪式知识的成员","研究该禁区的 Akademiya 学者","与花灵结成谒颂主关系或直接参与近期事件的人类"],"unlikely_known_by":["远离苍漠囿土的普通居民","未接触当地传统或近期调查的外来者","只把那伽朱那团视为传说的一般人"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["部分矫论团成员崇拜灵光，并将其理解为会以灵体形态与人沟通的能量。","斯露莎一度认为消除天上异象必须效仿西摩格、牺牲自身；后续仪式成功时她并未消亡。"]},"activation_keys":["花灵与灵光","Pari and Khvarena"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["任务触发条件、任务步骤与操作指引","战斗目标、敌人配置及生命值条件","道具操作和场景交互机制","成就、冒险阅历、原石、摩拉及其他任务奖励"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Khvarena 的现实世界词源及语言学琐闻不属于提瓦特世界内事实。","未将受污花灵最终化为净光翎或灵谷木的任一版本裁定为唯一结论，因为现有中英文来源相互冲突。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_sumeru_pari_khvarena","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Pari","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Pari","language":"en","revision_id":"1797217","source_text_sha256":"b1117d39a91dc7528ea892bad045488fc4a0a36bb88d0c43edf4108bc593e209"},{"source_id":"bwiki_sumeru_pari_khvarena","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"花灵","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E8%8A%B1%E7%81%B5","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"612613","source_text_sha256":"e2cb889d5f0d74387bc589ac3e03779b339dab548244a809a387dd90440ac5ef"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Khvarena","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Khvarena","language":"en","revision_id":"1708823","source_text_sha256":"860084b9a9fcafba2d7e481fea6aceaa874767c6267072c46a1c19596c33c8a8"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Khvarena of Good and Evil","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Khvarena_of_Good_and_Evil","language":"en","revision_id":"2089017","source_text_sha256":"7e9fd1b6aec76d7aea3b2502e2ce3638efe7a72f20bc58eaa7a80d0d84ca88bf"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_03","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"The Splendorous Sky That Day","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/The_Splendorous_Sky_That_Day","language":"en","revision_id":"2089018","source_text_sha256":"07c604b6983178fa63bac7f3cd857dc863d703b4fe4af450d541cc58133ac0d4"},{"source_id":"fandom_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_04","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Asipattravana Itihasa","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Asipattravana_Itihasa","language":"en","revision_id":"1597217","source_text_sha256":"6596fa12d56bfc13238d539d8d8247d1464b4f8507fbf07830b480fbd713608d"},{"source_id":"local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_01","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"彼时漫天异彩","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_73238.json#unit=7323821","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"e3e7b3d774220298a123e711965af5c9fdb9e4081899a1e931f9c5807e9afe64"},{"source_id":"local_sup_sumeru_pari_khvarena_02","provider":"local_dialogue","role":"local_dialogue_verification","title":"如是灵光悉示现","url":"local://YuanShenResources/CHS/Quest/Quest_73251.json#unit=7325134","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"OSCBWin6.7.54","source_text_sha256":"a316ff7bc6862071053e267c68071e4046a6c03d38f601aecccb7dc62e590d78"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"7f9077ce5e718ac639dd87b3cbf2aaa5d4877ed89ecc9d263fc94816c92713a0","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":["英文 Fandom 称普通花灵在生命终点化为净光翎，而被深渊污秽侵染、遭甘露花海拒绝的花灵会化为灵谷木；BWiki 则称无法回归甘露的受污花灵之力量会化为净光翎。"],"uncertain_claims":["灵光在第一次 Sabzeruz Festival 期间由 Nabu Malikata 赠予 Greater Lord Rukkhadevata 的说法被来源明确表述为传说。","每名花灵都有命定责任且必须独自承担的观念带有花灵内部信条性质。","灵光绝唱是灵光百种中最强实体的排序来自那先朱那的个人陈述；其当时隐瞒真实计划，故该排序未标为确认事实。"],"missing_evidence":["证据包缺少能够直接裁定受污花灵、净光翎与灵谷木之间确切转化关系的无冲突游戏内文本。"],"needs_human_review":true}}